  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Yemen Economic Tracking Initiative Phase IV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under AFFY, FCDO is supporting a fourth phase of YETI to provide robust data and analysis on economic trends and developments, with the overall aim of creating a shared understanding, informing policies, and allowing consistent messaging on reforms to support increased economic stability and reduced food insecurity for the vulnerable population.</narrative>
  </description>
